[A: Chadhavochu, B: Chadhavochu, C: Chadhavochu, D: Chadhavochu] jatha[A, B, C, D] ki Chadhavochu gunam undhi:
    chadhuvu_cheyyi(r: &maare Chadhivevaadu ni) -> sare_thappu[idhi, ChadhuvuThappu] ante:
