            thappu(e) icchey
        maare r3 ante parts.theesey().kachithanga()
        maare r2 ante parts.theesey().kachithanga()
        maare r1 ante parts.theesey().kachithanga()
        maare r0 ante parts.theesey().kachithanga()
        a ante &maare r0 ni A.chadhuvu_cheyyi()?
        b ante &maare r1 ni B.chadhuvu_cheyyi()?
        c ante &maare r2 ni C.chadhuvu_cheyyi()?
        d ante &maare r3 ni D.chadhuvu_cheyyi()?
        sare((a, b, c, d)) icchey

[A: Kotthadhi, B: Kotthadhi, C: Kotthadhi, D: Kotthadhi] jatha[A, B, C, D] ki Kotthadhi gunam undhi:
    kotthadhi() -> idhi ante:
        (A.kotthadhi(), B.kotthadhi(), C.kotthadhi(), D.kotthadhi()) icchey

